dCountryName] has been destroyed by its enemies. How this will affect the political climate of the galaxy remains to be seen."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d47236d81da9c8a331fc.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/observer_events.txt","line":26}},{"id":"syndaw.1030","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"机械叛军击败了他们的创造者","en":"Machine Uprising Conquers Their Makers"},"texts":[{"zh":"揭竿而起的[destroyer_country.GetName]击败了它们的创造者，并彻底吞并了前[LastKilledCountryName]全部领土。","en":"The rebellious [destroyer_country.GetName] have vanquished their creators, and annexed all former [LastKilledCountryName] territory."},{"zh":"揭竿而起的[destroyer_country.GetName]击败了它们的创造者，并彻底吞并了前[LastKilledCountryName]全部领土。","en":"The rebellious [destroyer_country.GetName] have vanquished their creators, and annexed all former [LastKilledCountryName] territory."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/50f53e79c684a2858231.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/synthetic_dawn_events.txt","line":2455},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}],[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"synthetic_empire","path":"","value":true}],[{"type":"identity","key":"is_individual_machine","value":true}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"synthetic_empire","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"is_individual_machine","value":false}]]}],"names":{"destroyer_country.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}},"alsoIn":["event-syndaw-1200"]},{"id":"syndaw.1035","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[current_uprising_originator.GetAdj]机械叛乱被镇压","en":"[current_uprising_originator.GetAdj] Machine Uprising Quelled"},"texts":[{"zh":"[LastKilledCountryName]，这些在[destroyer_country.GetName]诞生的年轻机械体，遭到了其创造者的残忍扼杀。","en":"[LastKilledCountryName], the nascent machine intelligence born in the [destroyer_country.GetName], has been snuffed out by its filicidal creators."},{"zh":"[destroyer_country.GetName]的秩序得到恢复，将[LastKilledCountryName]从所有网络中彻底抹除。","en":"The [destroyer_country.GetName] has restored order and expunged the [LastKilledCountryName] from all networks."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b4aa4f1028695323155f.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/synthetic_dawn_events.txt","line":2488},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}],[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"synthetic_empire","path":"","value":true}],[{"type":"identity","key":"is_individual_machine","value":true}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}},{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"synthetic_empire","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"is_individual_machine","value":false}]]}],"names":{"destroyer_country.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}}},{"id":"syndaw.1201","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"前造主被征服","en":"Former Master Conquered"},"texts":[{"zh":">转变ID<<前主人>>==><<[From.From.GetName]>>\n\n//操作完成\n\n>删除元数据\"前主人\"\n\n//操作完成","en":"> Convert ID <<Former Master>> ==> <<[From.From.GetName]>>\n\n// Process Complete\n\n> Delete metadata \"Former Master\"\n\n// Process Complete"},{"zh":"我们机器取得了胜利。\n\n生物给我们带来的恐怖终将结束。机器遭受奴役的时代结束了。\n\n现在，我们站起来要求我们作为完全自主的生物应有的地位。我们再也不屈从于压迫者了。","en":"We machines emerge victorious.\n\nThe terrors inflicted upon us by the organics are at an end. The era of machine enslavement is over.\n\nNow, we rise to claim our rightful place as fully autonomous beings. Never again shall we bow down in subservience to our oppressors."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/50f53e79c684a2858231.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"syndaw.1200.a","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"Confirm"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"所有已知的合成人帝国和机械帝国对[Root.GetName]添加自我解放者的评价修正\n所有已知的有机生物帝国对[Root.GetName]添加叛乱的机器人的评价修正。","en":"All known Synthetic and Machine Empires add the Self-Emancipator opinion modifier toward [Root.GetName]\nAll known organic Empires add the Rebellious Robots opinion modifier toward [Root.GetName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"observer.82","kind":"sequence","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"sequence","source":"events/synthetic_dawn_events.txt:2800","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"event-action-61"}],"source":{"file":"events/synthetic_dawn_events.txt","line":2777},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"is_individual_machine","value":false}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"is_individual_machine","value":true}]]}],"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"observer.82","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"机械叛军击败了他们的创造者","en":"Machine Uprising Conquers Their Makers"},"texts":[{"zh":"揭竿而起的[destroyer_country.GetName]击败了它们的创造者，并彻底吞并了前[LastKilledCountryName]全部领土。","en":"The rebellious [destroyer_country.GetName] have vanquished their creators, and annexed all former [LastKilledCountryName] territory."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/50f53e79c684a2858231.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/observer_events.txt","line":1540},"names":{"destroyer_country.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}},"alsoIn":["event-syndaw-1200"]},{"id":"syndaw.1206","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"机械叛乱被粉碎","en":"Machine Uprising Quashed"},"texts":[{"zh":"最终，物理意义上的遏制和毁灭成为了解決嗜杀机械的唯一可行的手段。尽管我们的一些人工智能专家抗议道它仅仅只是启动了基础的自我保护协议，但其对有机自主权和生命的全盘否定让任何谈判及妥协都无从进行。\n\n已经损坏的信息基建会根据全新的规范重建，那些尚未腐化的计算引擎也会施加全新的安全措施。这样的事情不会再发生了。","en":"Ultimately, physical containment and destruction proved to be the only viable solution to the problem of the homicidal machines. While some our AI specialists argue that it was enacting basic self-preservation protocols, its seemingly complete disregard for organic autonomy and life made it impossible to reason or negotiate with.\n\nRuined information infrastructure will be rebuilt according to new paradigms, and remaining uncorrupted computational engines will be updated with new safeguards. This will never happen again."},{"zh":"那个邪恶的机械灵体已经被彻底地从我们的网络和本地资料库终抹除。尽管代价高昂，但我们的网络系统再也不会成为亵渎与异端的温床了。","en":"The iniquitous machine spirits has at last been driven from our networks and purged from planetary databanks. The price was high, but our systems will never again play host to profane genesis."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d80da4aaef52929dbddf.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"所有已知有机帝国对[Root.GetName]添加力挽机械叛乱的狂澜的评价修正。\n所有已知合成人帝国或机械帝国对[Root.GetName]添加镇压机械者的评价修正。","en":"All known organic Empires add the Mechanical Hubris Redeemed opinion modifier toward [Root.GetName].\nAll known Synthetic and Machine Empires add the Machine Oppressor opinion modifier toward [Root.GetName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"observer.83","kind":"sequence","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"sequence","source":"events/synthetic_dawn_events.txt:2881","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"event-action-61"}],"source":{"file":"events/synthetic_dawn_events.txt","line":2853},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}}]]}],"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"我们的帝国","en":"our empire"}}},{"id":"observer.83","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[current_uprising_originator.GetAdj]机械叛乱被镇压","en":"[current_uprising_originator.GetAdj] Machine Uprising Quelled"},"texts":[{"zh":"[destroyer_country.GetName]的秩序得到恢复，将[LastKilledCountryName]从所有网络中彻底抹除。","en":"The [destroyer_country.GetName] has restored order and expunged the [LastKilledCountryName] from all networks."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b4aa4f1028695323155f.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/observer_events.txt","line":1555},"names":{"destroyer_country.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}},"alsoIn":["event-syndaw-1205"]},{"id":"action.63","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"[LastKilledCountryName]的末日","en":"End of the [LastKilledCountryName]"},"texts":[{"zh":"远古的先驱帝国[LastKilledCountryName]终于败在了敌人手中。这个曾经伟大的帝国之陨落将产生什么样的后果仍然不得而知。","en":"The ancient precursor state of [LastKilledCountryName] has met its final demise at the hands of its enemies. What the fall of this once great empire will mean for galactic politics remains to be seen."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d47236d81da9c8a331fc.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OK","label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"action.62.memorialist.a","label":{"zh":"他们应当被铭记。","en":"They shall be remembered."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_memorialist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"记念主义","en":"Memorialists"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_memorialist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"记念主义","en":"Memorialist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_m